回来了。当然，你总是要回到这儿的，因为这里是“原点”……","Expression":"e_kaixin.exp3","Command":"mouse_tracking disable","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":2400,"Priority":3,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:idle 2","VarFloats":[{"Name":"登场语音","Type":1,"Code":"equal 0"}]},{"Name":"朝晨","File":"c9fe8bdd3b52af4a1ae53bfc28222b13.motion3.json","Sound":"ab4dbb3324f489c94ec34b2cdcc1fe0d.mp3","Text":"唔唔唔，在那些食用褐色豆子冲泡的古怪液体的家伙离开前，我绝不会靠近餐桌一步！","Expression":"e_chijing.exp3","Command":"mouse_tracking disable","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":2400,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"TimeLimit":{"Hour":7,"Sustain":240},"NextMtn":"1:idle 3","VarFloats":[{"Name":"登场语音","Type":1,"Code":"equal 0"}]},{"Name":"信任-朝晨","File":"d23a101310f8a1a995da3994a11621f5.motion3.json","Sound":"635502110a4ea5fa5a89bbcaba9acf4e.mp3","Text":"不不，教典说，当你离开床褥时，要把它卷起，再把睡过的印迹抹平……没关系，你就呆在那儿，我来帮你！","Expression":"e_kaixin.exp3","Command":"mouse_tracking disable","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":4800,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"TimeLimit":{"Hour":7,"Sustain":240},"NextMtn":"1:idle 4","VarFloats":[{"Name":"登场语音","Type":1,"Code":"equal 0"}]},{"Name":"夜暮","File":"f8c98747bb8f72381f4bca18a59d1845.motion3.json","Sound":"772dcb9e1a3e35a9f19fcf7fc7ceb631.mp3","Text":"住在我隔壁的房客太吵了。可以让他们消停一些么？这些“罗马人”把我的圆都搅乱了……！","Expression":"e_nanguo.exp3","Command":"mouse_tracking disable","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":5000,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"TimeLimit":{"Hour":19,"Sustain":240},"NextMtn":"1:提议2","VarFloats":[{"Name":"登场语音","Type":1,"Code":"equal 0"}]},{"Name":"信任-夜暮","File":"886a3f216a1422997cf258f8e5e8e2d0.motion3.json","Sound":"338a3302eeef4e05f880e2631691bd2e.mp3","Text":"感谢你，维尔汀，你晃动箱子的频率和海浪拍岸完全一致。我睡得好极了。","Expression":"e_kaixin.exp3","Command":"mouse_tracking disable","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":4800,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"TimeLimit":{"Hour":19,"Sustain":240},"NextMtn":"1:idle 4","VarFloats":[{"Name":"登场语音","Type":1,"Code":"equal 0"}]}],"Tap":[{"Name":"初遇","File":"886a3f216a1422997cf258f8e5e8e2d0.motion3.json","Sound":"2b305109b36cb48e37f955eedcf8fdfc.mp3","Text":"一个曼德博集合……没错,和岛一样!这个集合里仍然有我的位置,就在我正站着的地方。","Expression":"e_chijing.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":5400,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:提议"},{"Name":"箱中气候","File":"c9fe8bdd3b52af4a1ae53bfc28222b13.motion3.json","Sound":"ffede744385f18e75b9a31b3a2135c8a.mp3","Text":"实际上，雨从未落下。它们都是静止的，因为任何一滴雨在它的下坠过程中都有一个暂时的位置~","Expression":"e_idle.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":2400,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true},{"Name":"致未来","File":"d5bab2f848b93de0e565b05ef1f75595.motion3.json","Sound":"b53f26b6fdcae3e9bfbad0d599342147.mp3","Text":"这里的和别处的一切，最终都会回到纯粹的数式之中。只是我还没能算出这个指向未来的式子……唔，目前的假设是……","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":3800,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:点头"},{"Name":"孑立","File":"886a3f216a1422997cf258f8e5e8e2d0.motion3.json","Sound":"dc47cdd0143b8fe77193b20ac9245481.mp3","Text":"二、三、五、七、十一、十三、十七、十九、二十三、二十九、三十一、三十七一……","Expression":"e_yansu.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":4800,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:idle 1"}],"1-3":[{"Name":"帽檐与发鬓","File":"d5bab2f848b93de0e565b05ef1f75595.motion3.json","Sound":"0e0b531851431d27107c0c4d2b9c45b3.mp3","Text":"什么？你是说……我的头发里有条奥勒什蒂鱼？这怎么可能呢……快给我看看！","Expression":"e_chijing.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":5800,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:摇头"},{"Name":"袖与手","File":"d5bab2f848b93de0e565b05ef1f75595.motion3.json","Sound":"0ed2fa179b7ed4cd7fa2c29ee9acb1f1.mp3","Text":"世界各地的人类不约而同地采取了十进制。瞧，这就是原因。","Expression":"e_kaixin.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":5200,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:提议"},{"Name":"衣着与身形","File":"8e85b9f5d81ef25b6adece0e450c3dd7.motion3.json","Sound":"ec364483cbef25639937d393f744c2b3.mp3","Text":"没错，这是我的小罐子。肉和骨头组成的小罐子，尽管是暂时的，但它总能很好地安放我们均匀的几何体。","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":2400,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:idle 5"}],"2-3":[{"Name":"嗜好","File":"c9fe8bdd3b52af4a1ae53bfc28222b13.motion3.json","Sound":"3ad825d40de43f5410d652522304016b.mp3","Text":"唔……我不太喜欢“嗜好”这个词，它听起来像是某种可以轻易放弃的、短暂的东西。","Expression":"e_nanguo.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":2400,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:idle 6"},{"Name":"赞赏","File":"8e85b9f5d81ef25b6adece0e450c3dd7.motion3.json","Sound":"ade0d80f20cddf5c89d3ef8f6726d343.mp3","Text":"维尔汀,你也在进步,就像“0”的进化史一样。曾经“0”只是一个占位符,渐渐地,它变成了一个不可或缺的数字,再后来,它成为了坐标系的中心。","Expression":"e_kaixin.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":2400,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:idle 7"},{"Name":"亲昵","File":"d5bab2f848b93de0e565b05ef1f75595.motion3.json","Sound":"22e30a7493bc4f4ae1318ebf698ad76b.mp3","Text":"快帮我看看答案……不可能！这本书犯了错误……我算出的明明是另一个结果！","Expression":"e_kaixin.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":2400,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:摇头2"}],"3-3":[{"Name":"闲谈1","File":"886a3f216a1422997cf258f8e5e8e2d0.motion3.json","Sound":"b5dc8ab726516a4d512149b47be1d1be.mp3","Text":"瞧瞧,我们这有矩形的画框,矩形的柜子,矩形的窗户……维尔汀，你还没意识到吗？矩形被滥用了！你应该多加一些三角形,它们才是更稳定的图形~","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":5400,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:idle 8"},{"Name":"闲谈2","File":"886a3f216a1422997cf258f8e5e8e2d0.motion3.json","Sound":"dfb6e93ca7e5a46ea86dfc8dded3ce2b.mp3","Text":"我尝试和百夫长小姐对话，但她一抛出那枚金币，我就晕了过去。这太无理了，我是说，她的运气，这完全不符合数学规律……","Expression":"e_chijing.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":7400,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:摇头2"},{"Name":"独白","File":"d5bab2f848b93de0e565b05ef1f75595.motion3.json","Sound":"20254bfa84594c19507200f24ea87237.mp3","Text":"证明一旦完成便是永恒的。但偶尔，我坐在海滩上，聆听母亲的梭边被海浪冲刷，发出不变的空响时，我会怀念那道现象世界的短促气音。","Expression":"e_idle.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":5200,"Priority":4,"Interruptable":true,"NextMtn":"1:idle 9"}],"4-6":[{"Name":"入队","File":"8e85b9f5d81ef25b6adece0e450c3dd7.motion3.json","Sound":"bd58915ae55cc50a1d5047680f880222.mp3","Text":"现在，这个集合包含了我。{$br}And now, I belong to this set.","Expression":"e_kaixin.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","Priority":3,"Interruptable":true},{"Name":"战前","File":"06c29c3bbe0d29acac4c841ed903ccd5.motion3.json","Sound":"8a55cc28a1b91792ceb34267af11f045.mp3","Text":"谁吃了豆子？{$br}Who ate beans?","Expression":"e_shengqi.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","MotionDuration":3800,"Priority":3,"Interruptable":true},{"Name":"择选咒语1","File":"886a3f216a1422997cf258f8e5e8e2d0.motion3.json","Sound":"548ab42b8d46e02ebf4365a1bca784de.mp3","Text":"已知……{$br}Given that ...","Expression":"e_chijing.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","Priority":3,"Interruptable":true},{"Name":"择选咒语2","File":"06c29c3bbe0d29acac4c841ed903ccd5.motion3.json","Sound":"f9c046aa1084812c998f4f05864c6eb8.mp3","Text":"易得……{$br}It could be found ...","Expression":"e_yansu.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","Priority":3,"Interruptable":true},{"Name":"择选高阶咒语","File":"8e85b9f5d81ef25b6adece0e450c3dd7.motion3.json","Sound":"2ec383be285bae18ce60d4b791c40430.mp3","Text":"绝佳的论据！{$br}A perfect argument!","Expression":"e_kaixin.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","Priority":3,"Interruptable":true},{"Name":"择选至终的仪式","File":"d23a101310f8a1a995da3994a11621f5.motion3.json","Sound":"d398288f05d50119c9ad87c0a560dd2d.mp3","Text":"最终的证明。{$br}The final demonstration.","PostCommand":"clear_exp","Priority":3,"Interruptable":true}],"5-5":[{"Name":"释放神秘术1-1","File":"90b3f0aceeae4d810ca29d76de9c8691.motion3.json","Sound":"5ef69d00091c16a6e0a0242c1976bd97.mp3","Text":"本质……胜过一切！{$br}The Form ... is above all!","Expression":"e_yansu.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","Priority":3,"Interruptable":true},{"Name":"释放神秘术1-2","File":"54c8d7b4b368961ec00dfb183ae9727f.motion3.json","Sound":"938b48e8b4fceef4cd8bd52c40f37a84.mp3","Text":"相交……然后切割！{$br}Intersect and divide!","Expression":"e_shengqi.exp3","PostCommand":"clear_exp","Priority":3,"Interruptable":true},{"Name":"释放神秘术2-1","File":"886a3f216a1422997cf258f8e5e8e2d0.motion3.json","Sound":"690ecd2b8cd12b20908ca1cf8de49635.mp3","Text":"你们是无理数吗？{$b